config BR2_PACKAGE_RGDS_MUSIC
	bool "rgds-music"
	depends on BR2_INSTALL_LIBSTDCPP
	select BR2_PACKAGE_FFMPEG
	select BR2_PACKAGE_FFMPEG_SWSCALE
	select BR2_PACKAGE_SDL2
	help
	  The music player's engine (src/music/engine.cpp): /usr/bin/rgds-music, which RG DS Core's launcher
	  starts when Settings > Sound > Music player is on. Built here, against the image's own FFmpeg, rather
	  than with the launcher: FFmpeg's structures differ between versions, so the engine is compiled against
	  the headers of the library it will load. Tracker modules play when BR2_PACKAGE_LIBOPENMPT is on.
